{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37704","headline":"侯家鹧鸪 · 郑谷","name":"侯家鹧鸪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江天梅雨湿江蓠，到处烟香是此时。\n苦竹岭无归去日，海棠花落旧栖枝。\n春宵思极兰灯暗，晓月啼多锦幕垂。\n唯有佳人忆南国，殷勤爲尔唱愁词。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37704.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37704","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"秦岭梅"}